<title>HONG KONG: SGA sets warrants on First Pacific Co.</title>
<headline>SGA sets warrants on First Pacific Co.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>SGA, Societe Generale Acceptance NV said on Wednesday it is issuing 290 million American style call warrants on shares of First Pacific Co Ltd .</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$10	  PREMIUM	 18.50 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.185     GEARING	 5.40x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  14.JAN.98    EXER LOT	20,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    PAYDATE	 04.FEB.97</p>
<p> NOTE		  CASH OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY AT ISSUER'S OPTION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
